-- so what makes a warrant worth anything is that it fails somewhere: a family of warrants is
-- informative exactly when there is a claim it refuses. This is the property a checkCIF pass, a
-- deposited diffraction pattern or an assay protocol has and a signature does not.
Informative : (Mol → Nat → Type 0) → Type 1
Informative W = (M : Mol) × (v : Nat) × (W M v → Empty)
